{"4304060":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"SONIC PICO PARK","steam_appid":4304060,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sonic dashes into the world of the hit indie game, PICO PARK!<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the multiplayer co-op action puzzle gameplay of the PICO PARK series like never before! In our latest entry, the PICO PARK series is teaming up with SEGA's legendary Sonic the Hedgehog!<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SONIC PICO PARK is a 2D action puzzle game where cooperation is essential!<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The rules are simple: just reach the goal plate on the right side of each stage. But the only way to succeed is for everyone to work together.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This exciting crossover lets every playable character use Sonic's iconic Spin Dash, while adding classic Sonic-style gameplay elements such as rings, loops, and springs! Team up with your friends and take on these new challenges together!<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just like the rest of the series, the game supports 2 to 8 players locally or online. All content can be enjoyed with any number of players! Online play also supports cross-play, and up to 7 local players can join online from a single PC.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combining the flair of Sonic and the puzzle teamwork fun of PICO PARK, this one-of-a-kind collaboration is packed with fun for everyone... whether you experience it with family, friends, your partner, or even new teammates you meet online!<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather your squad and try it today!<\/p>","about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sonic dashes into the world of the hit indie game, PICO PARK!<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the multiplayer co-op action 